{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35794","headline":"冬夜与修睦上人宿远公亭寄南岳玄泰禅师 · 李咸用","name":"冬夜与修睦上人宿远公亭寄南岳玄泰禅师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丈室掩孤灯，更深霰雹增。\n相看云梦客，共忆祝融僧。\n语合茶忘味，吟欹卷有棱。\n楚南山水秀，行止岂无凭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35794.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35794","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}